employment_summary:
The text describes professional history that includes the following roles:

1. Channel Marketing Manager at RingCentral (started in June 2022, currently ongoing);
2. Channel Marketing and Sales Activation Specialist at Poly (from July 2021 to June 2022);
3. Digital Marketing and Events Specialist, Coaching Programs at Scrum Alliance (from August 2019 to July 2021);
4. Administrative/Marketing Assistant at LMKR (from March 2015 to November 2016);
5. Web Support Technician at West Corporation (from June 2013 to March 2015).
